# The x86-64 instructions of the intrinsics, for the compiler's assembler
# (back/enc_x86.tach): one AT&T mnemonic per line, its encoding class, its
# mandatory prefix, opcode map and opcode, and flags (w: REX.W).
# compiler/arch/README.md gives the classes. A mnemonic the encoder's own
# table knows is not here.
#
# mnemonic | class | prefix | map | opcode | flags

pshufb | sse | 66 | 0f38 | 00 | -
pmovmskb | sse | 66 | 0f | d7 | -
pshuflw | ssei | f2 | 0f | 70 | -
crc32q | sse | f2 | 0f38 | f1 | w
